# An index after a number is refused where it stands (l2_check_fields): only an Array field is indexed, and its element
# is taken as one (unit_array_*).  The field check skipped every bracket atom, so `x: q[0]` with q an int went out as C
# indexing an int ("subscripted value is neither array nor pointer"): l2trans exit 0, gcc refused.  The same after a
# char, a size_t, a formal, in a return, an operand, an actual, a condition (the probe; the rows: this and _return_).
fn: peek () int
    int: q 3
    int: x 0
    x: q[0]
    return: x
end: peek
int: r 0
r: peek()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
